# Storms of Fate (battlefield.storms_of_fate#helper, Riverne Site #B01): Party of five at the entry: bob (completed) and
# dan (accepted, Prog 3) enter and get their 32001 on the win (bob with the skip flag 1); cat (accepted, Prog 0) and eve
# (no quest) are refused with the zone default's 7613 (DefaultActions.lua). On the win main's finish runs the quest's
# 32001 (StormsOfFate.cs): the Whisper of the Wyrmking and Prog 2 -> 3.
lists RiverneSiteB01/Unstable_Displacement/onTrigger RiverneSiteB01/onEventUpdate/32000 RiverneSiteB01/onEventFinish/32000 RiverneSiteB01/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RiverneSiteB01 pos=-611.3,1.8,693.2 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=RiverneSiteB01 pos=-611.3,1.8,693.2 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=RiverneSiteB01 pos=-611.3,1.8,693.2 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=RiverneSiteB01 pos=-611.3,1.8,693.2 job=WAR lvl=75
char eve zone=RiverneSiteB01 pos=-611.3,1.8,693.2 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate accepted
charvar Quest[3][86]Prog 2
bob: quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate completed
cat: quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate accepted
cat: charvar Quest[3][86]Prog 0
dan: quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate accepted
dan: charvar Quest[3][86]Prog 3
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger Unstable_Displacement
update 32000 option=1
finish
bob: trigger Unstable_Displacement
bob: update 32000 option=1
bob: finish
cat: trigger Unstable_Displacement
cat: update 32000 option=1
cat: finish
dan: trigger Unstable_Displacement
dan: update 32000 option=1
dan: finish
eve: trigger Unstable_Displacement
eve: update 32000 option=1
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill BAHAMUT
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
eve: finish
tick 11000
